<!-- 
  Below items are copy from the Maruti Suzuki full pronunciation lexicon.
  Maruti Suzuki full pronunciation lexicon for en-IN-AartiIndicNeural.
  Set voice.custom_lexicon_url to a publicly accessible copy when activating.

  Merged listening-tested rules:
  - Baleno: approved IPA.
  - Grand Vitara: no override; the approved v5 recordings exactly matched
    Aarti's default pronunciation in English and Hindi.
  - Fronx: approved rule, including uppercase FRONX.
  - Ertiga: approved v4 rule.
  - WagonR: v7 rule; Hindi approved, English remains unresolved.

  Maruti, Grand Vitara, and standalone Vitara overrides are intentionally absent.
  The e Vitara entry is retained separately.
  Other entries are retained from the existing full lexicon, not newly
  listening-validated. Swift has no override and uses the voice's default.
  Matching is case-sensitive. IPA phonemes must not contain whitespace;
  '.' marks syllables. Some phrases use aliases to single-token phonemes.
  https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/speech-service/speech-synthesis-markup-pronunciation#custom-lexicon
-->
